  "solution_ref": "$f(0)=0$, 접선 $y=f'(0)x$. $f(1)=2$, $y=xf(x)$의 $(1,2)$ 접선 $y=\\{f'(1)+2\\}x-f'(1)$. 일치 → $f'(1)=0$, $f'(0)=2$. $f=ax^3+bx^2+cx$: $c=2$, $3a+2b+2=0$, $a+b+c=2$ → $a=-2$, $b=2$. $f'(2)=-24+8+2=-14$",
